:19.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:20.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:20.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:20.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:20.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:21.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:21.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:21.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:21.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:22.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:22.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:22.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:22.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:23.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:23.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:23.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:23.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:23.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:23.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:24.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:24.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:24.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:24.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:25.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:25.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:25.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:25.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:26.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:26.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:26.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:26.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:27.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:27.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:27.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:27.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:27.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:27.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:28.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:28.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:28.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:28.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:29.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:29.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:29.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:29.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "snp1.7:30.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:30.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:30.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "snp1.7:30.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "snp1.7:31.1": "<p>{}", "snp1.7:31.2": "{}", "snp1.7:31.3": "{}</p>", "snp1.7:31.4": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"snp1.7:0.1": "Sutta Nipāta 1.7 ", "snp1.7:0.2": "Vasalasutta ", "snp1.7:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—", "snp1.7:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ", "snp1.7:1.3": "Atha kho bhagavā pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya sāvatthiṁ piṇḍāya pāvisi. ", "snp1.7:1.4": "Tena kho pana samayena aggikabhāradvājassa brāhmaṇassa nivesane aggi pajjalito hoti āhuti paggahitā. ", "snp1.7:1.5": "Atha kho bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ sapadānaṁ piṇḍāya caramāno yena aggikabhāradvājassa brāhmaṇassa nivesanaṁ tenupasaṅkami. ", "snp1.7:2.1": "Addasā kho aggikabhāradvājo brāhmaṇo bhagavantaṁ dūratova āgacchantaṁ. ", "snp1.7:2.2": "Disvāna bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ", "snp1.7:2.3": "“tatreva, muṇḍaka; ", "snp1.7:2.4": "tatreva, samaṇaka; ", "snp1.7:2.5": "tatreva, vasalaka, tiṭṭhāhī”ti. ", "snp1.7:3.1": "Evaṁ vutte, bhagavā aggikabhāradvājaṁ brāhmaṇaṁ etadavoca: ", "snp1.7:3.2": "“jānāsi pana tvaṁ, brāhmaṇa, vasalaṁ vā vasalakaraṇe vā dhamme”ti? ", "snp1.7:3.3": "“Na khvāhaṁ, bho gotama, jānāmi vasalaṁ vā vasalakaraṇe vā dhamme; ", "snp1.7:3.4": "sādhu me bhavaṁ gotamo tathā dhammaṁ desetu, yathāhaṁ jāneyyaṁ vasalaṁ vā vasalakaraṇe vā dhamme”ti. ", "snp1.7:3.5": "“Tena hi, brāhmaṇa, suṇāhi, sādhukaṁ manasi karohi; bhāsissāmī”ti. ", "snp1.7:3.6": "“Evaṁ, bho”ti kho aggikabhāradvājo brāhmaṇo bhagavato paccassosi. ", "snp1.7:3.7": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ", "snp1.7:4.1": "“Kodhano upanāhī ca, ", "snp1.7:4.2": "pāpamakkhī ca yo naro; ", "snp1.7:4.3": "Vipannadiṭṭhi māyāvī, ", "snp1.7:4.4": "taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:5.1": "Ekajaṁ vā dvijaṁ vāpi, ", "snp1.7:5.2": "yodha pāṇaṁ vihiṁsati; ", "snp1.7:5.3": "Yassa pāṇe dayā natthi, ", "snp1.7:5.4": "taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:6.1": "Yo hanti parirundhati, ", "snp1.7:6.2": "gāmāni nigamāni ca; ", "snp1.7:6.3": "Niggāhako samaññāto, ", "snp1.7:6.4": "taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:7.1": "Gāme vā yadi vā raññe, ", "snp1.7:7.2": "yaṁ paresaṁ mamāyitaṁ; ", "snp1.7:7.3": "Theyyā adinnamādeti, ", "snp1.7:7.4": "taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:8.1": "Yo have iṇamādāya, ", "snp1.7:8.2": "cujjamāno palāyati; ", "snp1.7:8.3": "Na hi te iṇamatthīti, ", "snp1.7:8.4": "taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:9.1": "Yo ve kiñcikkhakamyatā, ", "snp1.7:9.2": "panthasmiṁ vajantaṁ janaṁ; ", "snp1.7:9.3": "Hantvā kiñcikkhamādeti, ", "snp1.7:9.4": "taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:10.1": "Attahetu parahetu, ", "snp1.7:10.2": "dhanahetu ca yo naro; ", "snp1.7:10.3": "Sakkhipuṭṭho musā brūti, ", "snp1.7:10.4": "taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:11.1": "Yo ñātīnaṁ sakhīnaṁ vā, ", "snp1.7:11.2": "dāresu paṭidissati; ", "snp1.7:11.3": "Sāhasā sampiyena vā, ", "snp1.7:11.4": "taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:12.1": "Yo mātaraṁ pitaraṁ vā, ", "snp1.7:12.2": "jiṇṇakaṁ gatayobbanaṁ; ", "snp1.7:12.3": "Pahu santo na bharati, ", "snp1.7:12.4": "taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:13.1": "Yo mātaraṁ pitaraṁ vā, ", "snp1.7:13.2": "Bhātaraṁ bhaginiṁ sasuṁ; ", "snp1.7:13.3": "Hanti roseti vācāya, ", "snp1.7:13.4": "Taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:14.1": "Yo atthaṁ pucchito santo, ", "snp1.7:14.2": "Anatthamanusāsati; ", "snp1.7:14.3": "Paṭicchannena manteti, ", "snp1.7:14.4": "Taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:15.1": "Yo katvā pāpakaṁ kammaṁ, ", "snp1.7:15.2": "Mā maṁ jaññāti icchati; ", "snp1.7:15.3": "Yo paṭicchannakammanto, ", "snp1.7:15.4": "Taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:16.1": "Yo ve parakulaṁ gantvā, ", "snp1.7:16.2": "Bhutvāna sucibhojanaṁ; ", "snp1.7:16.3": "Āgataṁ nappaṭipūjeti, ", "snp1.7:16.4": "Taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:17.1": "Yo brāhmaṇaṁ samaṇaṁ vā, ", "snp1.7:17.2": "Aññaṁ vāpi vanibbakaṁ; ", "snp1.7:17.3": "Musāvādena vañceti, ", "snp1.7:17.4": "Taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:18.1": "Yo brāhmaṇaṁ samaṇaṁ vā, ", "snp1.7:18.2": "Bhattakāle upaṭṭhite; ", "snp1.7:18.3": "Roseti vācā na ca deti, ", "snp1.7:18.4": "Taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:19.1": "Asataṁ yodha pabrūti, ", "snp1.7:19.2": "Mohena paliguṇṭhito; ", "snp1.7:19.3": "Kiñcikkhaṁ nijigīsāno, ", "snp1.7:19.4": "Taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:20.1": "Yo cattānaṁ samukkaṁse, ", "snp1.7:20.2": "Pare ca mavajānāti; ", "snp1.7:20.3": "Nihīno sena mānena, ", "snp1.7:20.4": "Taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:21.1": "Rosako kadariyo ca, ", "snp1.7:21.2": "Pāpiccho maccharī saṭho; ", "snp1.7:21.3": "Ahiriko anottappī, ", "snp1.7:21.4": "Taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:22.1": "Yo buddhaṁ paribhāsati, ", "snp1.7:22.2": "Atha vā tassa sāvakaṁ; ", "snp1.7:22.3": "Paribbājaṁ gahaṭṭhaṁ vā, ", "snp1.7:22.4": "Taṁ jaññā vasalo iti. ", "snp1.7:23.1": "Yo ve anarahaṁ santo, ", "snp1.7:23.2": "Arahaṁ paṭijānāti; ", "snp1.7:23.3": "Coro sabrahmake loke, ", "snp1.7:23.4": "Eso kho vasalādhamo; ", "snp1.7:23.5": "Ete kho vasalā vuttā, ", "snp1.7:23.6": "Mayā yete pakāsitā. ", "snp1.7:24.1": "Na jaccā vasalo hoti, ", "snp1.7:24.2": "Na jaccā hoti brāhmaṇo; ", "snp1.7:24.3": "Kammunā vasalo hoti, ", "snp1.7:24.4": "Kammunā hoti brāhmaṇo. ", "snp1.7:25.1": "Tadamināpi jānātha, ", "snp1.7:25.2": "Yathāmedaṁ nidassanaṁ; ", "snp1.7:25.3": "Caṇḍālaputto sopāko, ", "snp1.7:25.4": "Mātaṅgo iti vissuto. ", "snp1.7:26.1": "So yasaṁ paramaṁ patto, ", "snp1.7:26.2": "Mātaṅgo yaṁ sudullabhaṁ; ", "snp1.7:26.3": "Āgacchuṁ tassupaṭṭhānaṁ, ", "snp1.7:26.4": "Khattiyā brāhmaṇā bahū. ", "snp1.7:27.1": "Devayānaṁ abhiruyha, ", "snp1.7:27.2": "Virajaṁ so mahāpathaṁ; ", "snp1.7:27.3": "Kāmarāgaṁ virājetvā, ", "snp1.7:27.4": "Brahmalokūpago ahu; ", "snp1.7:27.5": "Na naṁ jāti nivāresi, ", "snp1.7:27.6": "Brahmalokūpapattiyā. ", "snp1.7:28.1": "Ajjhāyakakule jātā, ", "snp1.7:28.2": "Brāhmaṇā mantabandhavā; ", "snp1.7:28.3": "Te ca pāpesu kammesu, ", "snp1.7:28.4": "Abhiṇhamupadissare. ", "snp1.7:29.1": "Diṭṭheva dhamme gārayhā, ", "snp1.7:29.2": "Samparāye ca duggati; ", "snp1.7:29.3": "Na ne jāti nivāreti, ", "snp1.7:29.4": "Duggatyā garahāya vā. ", "snp1.7:30.1": "Na jaccā vasalo hoti, ", "snp1.7:30.2": "Na jaccā hoti brāhmaṇo; ", "snp1.7:30.3": "Kammunā vasalo hoti, ", "snp1.7:30.4": "Kammunā hoti brāhmaṇo”ti. ", "snp1.7:31.1": "Evaṁ vutte, aggikabhāradvājo brāhmaṇo bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ", "snp1.7:31.2": "“abhikkantaṁ, bho gotama …pe… ", "snp1.7:31.3": "upāsakaṁ maṁ bhavaṁ gotamo dhāretu ajjatagge pāṇupetaṁ saraṇaṁ gatan”ti. ", "snp1.7:31.4": "Vasalasuttaṁ sattamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"snp1.7:0.1": "", "snp1.7:0.2": "", "snp1.7:1.1": "", "snp1.7:1.2": "", "snp1.7:1.3": "", "snp1.7:1.4": "", "snp1.7:1.5": "", "snp1.7:2.1": "", "snp1.7:2.2": "", "snp1.7:2.3": "tatreva → atreva (sya-all, mr) ", "snp1.7:2.4": "", "snp1.7:2.5": "", "snp1.7:3.1": "", "snp1.7:3.2": "", "snp1.7:3.3": "", "snp1.7:3.4": "", "snp1.7:3.5": "", "snp1.7:3.6": "", "snp1.7:3.7": "", "snp1.7:4.1": "", "snp1.7:4.2": "", "snp1.7:4.3": "", "snp1.7:4.4": "", "snp1.7:5.1": "", "snp1.7:5.2": "", "snp1.7:5.3": "", "snp1.7:5.4": "", "snp1.7:6.1": "parirundhati → uparundheti (sya-all); uparundhati (mr) ", "snp1.7:6.2": "", "snp1.7:6.3": "Niggāhako → nigghātako (?) ", "snp1.7:6.4": "", "snp1.7:7.1": "", "snp1.7:7.2": "", "snp1.7:7.3": "adinnamādeti → adinnaṁ ādiyati (bj, pts-vp-pli1); adinnaṁ āneti (sya-all) ", "snp1.7:7.4": "", "snp1.7:8.1": "", "snp1.7:8.2": "cujjamāno → bhuñjamāno (sya-all, mr) ", "snp1.7:8.3": ""